      "statement": "An above-threshold Sentinel fraud score drives HMS's HRC-07 FRAUD_MODEL_HIGH hold reason code, classified disclosure tier R (restricted), accounting for roughly 8% of all holds with a median time-to-disposition of about 1 hour 35 minutes.",
