      "id": "claim_6b45067f1cb04af4892074a06c53362a",
      "statement": "As a Tier 1 model, Sentinel requires full independent validation before use and annual review thereafter under MRM-POL-02's four-tier scheme (Tier 1/2/3/EUA).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/mrm-pol-02-v7.0-model-risk-management-policy-extract.md#L36-L40",
